{"seq":1,"slug":"http-caching-strategies","title":"HTTP 缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/network-performance/http-caching-strategies","wordCount":783,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"http-缓存策略\">HTTP 缓存策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HTTP 缓存分强缓存与协商缓存两级。强缓存（Cache-Control/Expires）在有效期内直接使用本地副本，不发请求，是最快的一档；过期后进入协商缓存（ETag/If-None-Match、Last-Modified/If-Modified-Since），浏览器带验证信息询问服务器，未变化则返回 304 只复用副本。实践中的关键决策是&quot;缓存多久 + 如何失效&quot;：带内容哈希的静态资源可以设很长的 max-age 用 immutable，HTML 等入口文件则要短缓存或 no-cache 以便及时发版。Service Worker 能在浏览器与网络之间再加一层可控缓存，实现离线与精细策略；多层缓存（SW → HTTP → CDN）需保证失效一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存的价值\">缓存的价值</h2><p>HTTP 缓存是 Web 性能优化中投入产出比最高的手段之一。一个合理配置的缓存策略可以将重复访问的页面加载时间从数秒降至毫秒级，同时大幅减少服务器负载和带宽消耗。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[浏览器请求资源] --&gt; B{本地有缓存?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[向服务器请求]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{缓存是否过期?}&#10;    D --&gt;|未过期: 强缓存| E[&quot;直接使用缓存 (200 from cache)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|已过期| F{协商缓存验证}&#10;    F --&gt;|未修改| G[&quot;使用缓存 (304 Not Modified)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|已修改| H[&quot;下载新资源 (200 OK)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[浏览器请求资源] --&gt; B{本地有缓存?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[向服务器请求]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{缓存是否过期?}\n    D --&gt;|未过期: 强缓存| E[\"直接使用缓存 (200 from cache)\"]\n    D --&gt;|已过期| F{协商缓存验证}\n    F --&gt;|未修改| G[\"使用缓存 (304 Not Modified)\"]\n    F --&gt;|已修改| H[\"下载新资源 (200 OK)\"]\n    C --&gt; H</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"强缓存-cache-control\">强缓存：Cache-Control</h2><p>Cache-Control 是 HTTP 缓存的核心头部，它定义了资源的缓存策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用指令\">常用指令</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>max-age=N</td>\n<td>资源在 N 秒内有效</td>\n<td>静态资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>no-cache</td>\n<td>每次使用前必须向服务器验证</td>\n<td>动态内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>no-store</td>\n<td>禁止任何缓存</td>\n<td>敏感数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>public</td>\n<td>允许 CDN 等中间层缓存</td>\n<td>公开资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>private</td>\n<td>只允许浏览器缓存</td>\n<td>用户私有数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>immutable</td>\n<td>资源永不变更（在 max-age 内）</td>\n<td>带哈希的静态资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stale-while-revalidate=N</td>\n<td>过期后 N 秒内允许使用旧缓存+后台更新</td>\n<td>平衡新鲜度和速度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"典型缓存策略\">典型缓存策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[资源类型] --&gt; B{是否包含哈希指纹?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{是否频繁变化?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[&quot;Cache-Control: no-cache&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{是否敏感数据?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;Cache-Control: private, no-cache&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[资源类型] --&gt; B{是否包含哈希指纹?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[\"Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{是否频繁变化?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[\"Cache-Control: no-cache\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{是否敏感数据?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"Cache-Control: private, no-cache\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400\"]</pre><h3 id=\"nginx-缓存配置\">Nginx 缓存配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"location ~* \\.(js|css|woff2|webp|avif)$ {&#10;    if ($uri ~* &quot;\\.[a-f0-9]{8,}\\.&quot;) {&#10;        add_header Cache-Control &quot;public, max-age=31536000, immutable&quot;;&#10;    }&#10;    if ($uri !~* &quot;\\.[a-f0-9]{8,}\\.&quot;) {&#10;        add_header Cache-Control &quot;public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400&quot;;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    add_header Vary &quot;Accept-Encoding&quot;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;location = /index.html {&#10;    add_header Cache-Control &quot;no-cache&quot;;&#10;    add_header ETag &quot;&quot;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;location /api/ {&#10;    add_header Cache-Control &quot;private, no-cache&quot;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>location ~* \\.(js|css|woff2|webp|avif)$ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ($uri ~* \"\\.[a-f0-9]{8,}\\.\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        add_header Cache-Control \"public, max-age=31536000, immutable\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ($uri !~* \"\\.[a-f0-9]{8,}\\.\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        add_header Cache-Control \"public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header Vary \"Accept-Encoding\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>location = /index.html {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header Cache-Control \"no-cache\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header ETag \"\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>location /api/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header Cache-Control \"private, no-cache\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"协商缓存-etag-与-last-modified\">协商缓存：ETag 与 Last-Modified</h2><p>当强缓存过期后，浏览器通过协商缓存机制向服务器验证资源是否仍然有效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"etag-实体标签\">ETag（实体标签）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /style.css&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + ETag: &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;&#10;    Note over B: 缓存过期后...&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /style.css + If-None-Match: &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 对比 ETag&#10;    alt 未修改&#10;        S-&gt;&gt;B: 304 Not Modified (无 body)&#10;    else 已修改&#10;        S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + ETag: &quot;def456&quot; + 新内容&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant B as 浏览器\n    participant S as 服务器\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /style.css\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + ETag: \"abc123\"\n\n    Note over B: 缓存过期后...\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /style.css + If-None-Match: \"abc123\"\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 对比 ETag\n    alt 未修改\n        S-&gt;&gt;B: 304 Not Modified (无 body)\n    else 已修改\n        S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + ETag: \"def456\" + 新内容\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"last-modified\">Last-Modified</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /data.json&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + Last-Modified: Wed, 15 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT&#10;&#10;    Note over B: 缓存过期后...&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /data.json + If-Modified-Since: Wed, 15 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT&#10;    alt 未修改&#10;        S-&gt;&gt;B: 304 Not Modified&#10;    else 已修改&#10;        S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + 新的 Last-Modified + 新内容&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant B as 浏览器\n    participant S as 服务器\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /data.json\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + Last-Modified: Wed, 15 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT\n\n    Note over B: 缓存过期后...\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /data.json + If-Modified-Since: Wed, 15 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT\n    alt 未修改\n        S-&gt;&gt;B: 304 Not Modified\n    else 已修改\n        S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK + 新的 Last-Modified + 新内容\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>ETag</th>\n<th>Last-Modified</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精度</td>\n<td>字节级（基于内容哈希）</td>\n<td>秒级（基于修改时间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开销</td>\n<td>需要计算哈希</td>\n<td>文件系统直接提供</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>高（内容变即变）</td>\n<td>中（可能有虚假修改）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（ETag 存在时忽略）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"service-worker-缓存\">Service Worker 缓存</h2><p>Service Worker 提供了编程式的缓存控制能力，可以实现比 HTTP 缓存更灵活的策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const CACHE_VERSION = &#39;v1.2.0&#39;;&#10;const STATIC_CACHE = `static-${CACHE_VERSION}`;&#10;const DYNAMIC_CACHE = `dynamic-${CACHE_VERSION}`;&#10;const API_CACHE = `api-${CACHE_VERSION}`;&#10;&#10;const STATIC_ASSETS = [&#39;/&#39;, &#39;/index.html&#39;, &#39;/styles/main.css&#39;, &#39;/js/app.js&#39;, &#39;/images/logo.svg&#39;];&#10;&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;install&#39;, (event: ExtendableEvent) =&gt; {&#10;  event.waitUntil(caches.open(STATIC_CACHE).then((cache) =&gt; cache.addAll(STATIC_ASSETS)));&#10;});&#10;&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;activate&#39;, (event: ExtendableEvent) =&gt; {&#10;  event.waitUntil(&#10;    caches&#10;      .keys()&#10;      .then((keys) =&gt; Promise.all(keys.filter((key) =&gt; !key.includes(CACHE_VERSION)).map((key) =&gt; caches.delete(key)))),&#10;  );&#10;});&#10;&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;fetch&#39;, (event: FetchEvent) =&gt; {&#10;  const { request } = event;&#10;  const url = new URL(request.url);&#10;&#10;  if (url.pathname.startsWith(&#39;/api/&#39;)) {&#10;    event.respondWith(networkFirst(request, API_CACHE));&#10;  } else if (request.destination === &#39;image&#39;) {&#10;    event.respondWith(cacheFirst(request, DYNAMIC_CACHE));&#10;  } else {&#10;    event.respondWith(staleWhileRevalidate(request, STATIC_CACHE));&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;async function cacheFirst(request: Request, cacheName: string): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;  const cached = await caches.match(request);&#10;  if (cached) return cached;&#10;&#10;  const response = await fetch(request);&#10;  const cache = await caches.open(cacheName);&#10;  cache.put(request, response.clone());&#10;  return response;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function networkFirst(request: Request, cacheName: string): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;  try {&#10;    const response = await fetch(request);&#10;    const cache = await caches.open(cacheName);&#10;    cache.put(request, response.clone());&#10;    return response;&#10;  } catch {&#10;    const cached = await caches.match(request);&#10;    if (cached) return cached;&#10;    return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: &#39;offline&#39; }), {&#10;      status: 503,&#10;      headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; },&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function staleWhileRevalidate(request: Request, cacheName: string): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;  const cache = await caches.open(cacheName);&#10;  const cached = await cache.match(request);&#10;&#10;  const fetchPromise = fetch(request).then((response) =&gt; {&#10;    cache.put(request, response.clone());&#10;    return response;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return cached ?? fetchPromise;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CACHE_VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'v1.2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STATIC_CACHE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `static-${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CACHE_VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DYNAMIC_CACHE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `dynamic-${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7